<title>AUSTRIA: Bau Holding takes over Germany's Moll.</title>
<headline>Bau Holding takes over Germany's Moll.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian construction firm Bau Holding AG said on Wednesday it was taking over the operations of the Munich-based building group Leonhard Moll AG.</p>
<p>Moll will transfer all its current construction units to Bau Holding and will in return get a stake in Bau Holding, Bau Holding said in a statement.</p>
<p>Moll has a workforce of around 750. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
